tagline = "Terra's quiet balcony"
lore = "A short hop from Terra, the Moon is where people go to look back at it. Its fuel comes up out of Terra's gravity a canister at a time, which is why it costs what it costs. The domes keep the air in, not the warmth: bring a jacket."
orbit_width = 0.03
